[00:04.33]in times of loneliness
[00:06.75]when i feel like giving everything
[00:10.48]i own in my life
[00:14.00]in exchange for a moment or two
[00:17.56]just having you
[00:20.24]by my side
[00:23.17]in times of desperation
[00:26.07]when all i could do
